With a .booping marker in the cwd the run appends exactly one [set] line,
naming the plan and the keys it touched, to the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/demo/index.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping set vault/plans/demo/index.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stderr --
updated vault/plans/demo/index.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [set] vault/plans/demo/index.md status
-- expected/cwd/vault/plans/demo/index.md --
---
title: Foo
status: in-progress
---
# Body
